  {:name "aslam" :created "2013-01-02 22:33" :body "<p>hi, what type of antenna to use, thanks</p>" :children [ {:name "Stian Eikeland" :created "2013-01-03 23:07" :body "<p>I use of a couple of different ones, a cheap directional one from ebay - and a the one that was bundled with my Alfa Network usb adapter ( <a href=\"http://www.alfa.com.tw/products_show.php?pc=90&amp;ps=23\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.alfa.com.tw/prod...</a> ). I would recommend googling around a bit, as I haven't really done that much research on good and cheap antennas.</p>" :children []}]}
  {:name "Jefferson Nunes" :created "2013-01-17 17:41" :body "<p>So, what you can tell me about this mod? It really improves the sinal strength?</p>" :children [ {:name "Stian Eikeland" :created "2013-01-18 13:11" :body "<p>Hello,<br>I haven't had much time for a comparative study, but what I use it for is a wireless bridge w/ a directional antenna.<br>Before doing the mod and using the directional I experienced lots of disconnects and SSH sessions had high jitter.<br>Now it's pretty stable for my purposes: Link Quality=70/70  Signal level=-39 dBm</p><p>I do not know if the overall signal is better with a good omni compared to the on-board.</p>" :children []}]}
